=== 4. Holding-period sensitivity on REGIME_DEPENDENT assets ===
Momentum: long the previous 5-day return; hold = 1 / 2 / 3 / 5 days per predeclared grid. Params: walk-forward per segment train=252d / test=84d / warmup=60d / overlap=60d, min 400 bars/segment, 4 contiguous volatility blocks, compared vs coin-flip null on the same segments

Segments: 4 contiguous blocks by date, past-only volatility classifier (turbulent = block median trailing-60-bar realized vol > series-wide median)

  AMZN hold=1: verdict REGIME_STABLE      cand_disp +0.005 null_disp +0.012 cand_medians [0.065, 0.076, 0.077]
  AMZN hold=2: verdict REGIME_STABLE      cand_disp +0.005 null_disp +0.061 cand_medians [0.065, 0.076, 0.077]
